    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Data structure design</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash map + array</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/insert-delete-getrandom-o1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 380</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Insert Delete GetRandom O(1)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A hash map gives O(1) membership but cannot pick a uniform random element; an array picks uniformly but deletes in O(n). Use both: a packed array of values plus a map from value to index, and delete by moving the last value into the hole. Every operation is O(1) on average.</p>\n"
